          heading: "1. Zero-Upload Client-Side Calculators",
          body: [
            "All SpecMatrix interactive calculators (airline checkers, USB-PD port allocators, cart price calculators, priority weighting simulators, bike compatibility checkers, and HomeTech TCO estimators) execute 100% locally in your browser. Inputs you type or select are never transmitted to or stored on SpecMatrix servers.",
          ],
        },
        {
          heading: "2. Advertising & Google AdSense",
          body: [
            `SpecMatrix Global uses Google AdSense (Publisher ID: ${cfg.adsenseId}) and authorized ad partners to fund independent specification verification. Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to this or other websites where permitted by regional consent rules. You may opt out of personalized advertising via Google Ad Settings.`,
          ],
        },
        {
          heading: "3. EU / EEA / UK / Swiss Privacy & Google Consent Mode v2",
          body: [
            "SpecMatrix Global currently serves English (EN) and Korean (KO) hubs and ships Google Consent Mode v2 regional defaults on every page so that ad_storage, ad_user_data, ad_personalization, and analytics_storage default to 'denied' for visitors from the EEA, UK, and Switzerland.",
            "Deploying a Google-certified Consent Management Platform (CMP) opt-in banner is enforced as a mandatory release gate prior to activating dedicated European locales (DE/ES) or enabling personalized EEA advertising.",
          ],
        },
        {
          heading: "4. Outbound Affiliate Links & Your Rights",
          body: [
            "When you click an outbound affiliate link (e.g., Amazon Associates or Coupang Partners), the destination retailer applies its own privacy and cookie policy. Depending on your jurisdiction (GDPR, CCPA, Korea PIPA), you have the right to inquire about or request deletion of any correspondence submitted to our editorial desk.",
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
    ko: {
      title: "개인정보처리방침 및 쿠키·Consent Mode v2 안내",
      subtitle:
        "SpecMatrix Global의 개인정보 최소 수집 원칙, 클라이언트 로컬 계산기 처리 방식, 광고 쿠키 및 EEA·영국·스위스 Google Consent Mode v2 기본값 적용 방침을 안내합니다.",
      sections: [
        {
          heading: "1. 회원가입 없음 · 브라우저 로컬 계산기 처리",
          body: [
            "SpecMatrix Global은 별도의 회원가입이나 로그인을 요구하지 않으며, 항공사 조회·USB-PD 시뮬레이터·장바구니 실단가 계산기·자전거 호환 체커·HomeTech 전력 TCO 계산기에 입력한 모든 값은 사용자 브라우저 내에서만 100% 로컬 연산됩니다. 입력값은 당사 서버로 전송되거나 저장되지 않습니다.",
          ],
        },
        {
          heading: "2. 구글 애드센스(AdSense) 및 제3자 쿠키 안내",
          body: [
            `본 사이트는 무료 데이터 검증 서비스 운영을 위해 Google AdSense (게시자 ID: ${cfg.adsenseId})를 연동합니다. Google 등 제3자 광고 사업자는 지역별 동의 규정이 허용하는 범위에서 쿠키를 사용해 사용자의 이전 방문 기록에 기반한 맞춤형 광고를 게재할 수 있으며, 사용자는 Google 광고 설정에서 맞춤형 광고를 언제든 해제할 수 있습니다.`,
          ],
        },
        {
          heading: "3. 유럽 EEA·영국·스위스 프라이버시 및 Google Consent Mode v2",
          body: [
            "SpecMatrix Global은 현재 영어(EN)·한국어(KO) 허브를 운영 중이며, 모든 페이지에 Google Consent Mode v2 지역 기본값을 적용해 유럽경제지역(EEA)·영국·스위스 방문자에 대해 ad_storage, ad_user_data, ad_personalization, analytics_storage를 기본 차단(denied) 상태로 유지합니다.",
            "유럽 전용 로케일(DE/ES) 정식 오픈 및 맞춤형 EEA 광고 활성화 전에는 Google 인증 동의 관리 플랫폼(CMP) 배너 탑재를 필수 배포 게이트로 적용합니다.",
          ],
        },
        {
          heading: "4. 외부 제휴 링크 및 이용자 권리",
          body: [
            "쿠팡 파트너스, 아마존 어소시에이트 등 외부 스토어 링크를 클릭해 이동한 이후에는 해당 쇼핑몰의 개인정보처리방침이 적용됩니다. 오류 제보 등을 통해 당사에 전달된 문의 내역의 열람·삭제는 문의 페이지를 통해 언제든 요청할 수 있습니다.",
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
  },
  contact: {
    en: {
      title: "Contact & Interactive Spec Discrepancy Reporter",
      subtitle:
        "Spotted a manufacturer hardware revision, updated airline battery rule, nutrition label reformulation, or 220V/power discrepancy? Submit an instant pre-filled GitHub correction report or copy structured Markdown below.",
      sections: [
        {
          heading: "Priority Verification SLA",
          body: [
            "Safety-critical corrections (airline Wh/MOLIT rule changes, hookless tire pressure limits, 120V/220V electrical ratings, or UPS waveform updates) are triaged within 24 hours against Tier-1 official documentation.",
            "Editorial Policy: We do not accept paid placement, sponsored rankings, or link exchanges. All updates require a verifiable manufacturer datasheet, regulatory filing, or official label source.",
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
    ko: {
      title: "스펙 오류 제보 및 데이터 정정 (Spec Corrections)",
      subtitle:
        "제조사 하드웨어 리비전, 항공사 기내 규정 개정, 영양성분 리뉴얼, 220V·소비전력 오차를 발견하셨나요? 아래 인터랙티브 제보 폼에서 GitHub 정정 이슈를 원클릭 생성하거나 마크다운 리포트를 복사할 수 있습니다.",
      sections: [
        {
          heading: "안전·규정 오류 최우선 검증 원칙",
          body: [
            "안전과 직결되는 항목(항공사 Wh·국토부 규정 변경, 후크리스 최대 공기압, 120V/220V 전압·UPS 파형, KC/PSE 안전인증 변동)은 공식 원천 근거 확인 후 24시간 이내 최우선 핫픽스를 원칙으로 합니다.",
            "편집 독립성 안내: 유료 순위 조작, 협찬 리뷰, 백링크 교환 요청에는 응하지 않으며 모든 정정 요청은 제조사 공식 매뉴얼·규제 DB 출처 확인 후 반영됩니다.",
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
  },
};

const pageData = CONTENT[legal][locale];

const reporterCfg = {
  locale,
  repoIssuesUrl: "https://github.com/kbu3986/specmatrix-global/issues/new",
  copiedText: isKo ? "마크다운 리포트 복사됨 ✓" : "Copied Report Markdown ✓",
  copyFailedText: isKo ? "복사 실패 — 미리보기에서 직접 복사하세요" : "Copy failed — select preview text manually",
  copyBtnText: isKo ? "리포트 마크다운 복사" : "Copy Report Markdown",
};

const jsonLd = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    name: pageData.title,
    description: pageData.subtitle,
    url: `${SITE_URL}${currentPath}`,
    inLanguage: locale,
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    itemListElement: [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        position: 1,
        name: isKo ? "홈" : "Home",
        item: `${SITE_URL}/${locale}/`,
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        position: 2,
        name: LEGAL_LABELS[legal][locale],
        item: `${SITE_URL}${currentPath}`,
      },
    ],
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`${pageData.title} | SpecMatrix Global`}
  description={pageData.subtitle}
  locale={locale}
  currentPath={currentPath}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500">
    <a href={withBase(`/${locale}/`)} class="hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline">
      {isKo ? "홈" : "Home"}
    </a>
    <span>/</span>
    <span class="font-medium text-slate-800">{LEGAL_LABELS[legal][locale]}</span>
  </nav>

  <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
    <article class="lab-card space-y-6 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 lg:col-span-9">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-5">
        <span class="badge-info font-mono uppercase">{legal}</span>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
          {pageData.title}
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">{pageData.subtitle}</p>
      </header>

      {legal === "contact" && (
        <section
          id="spec-discrepancy-form"
          data-config={safeJsonLd(reporterCfg)}
          class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-5 space-y-4"
          aria-labelledby="reporter-heading"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="badge-pass font-mono text-[11px]">
                {isKo ? "LIVE GITHUB ISSUE & MARKDOWN GENERATOR" : "LIVE GITHUB ISSUE & MARKDOWN GENERATOR"}
              </span>
              <h2 id="reporter-heading" class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">
                {isKo ? "인터랙티브 스펙 오류 제보 폼" : "Interactive Spec Discrepancy Reporter"}
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <label for="rep-vertical" class="block font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-slate-600">
                {isKo ? "버티컬 (Vertical)" : "Vertical"}
              </label>
              <select
                id="rep-vertical"
                class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-900 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none"
              >
                <option value="wattcheck">WattCheck (Power Bank / GaN / Airlines)</option>
                <option value="puregram">PureGram (Energy Gel / Electrolytes / Creatine)</option>
                <option value="cyclegear">CycleGear (Power Meter / GPS / Tires / Hookless)</option>
                <option value="hometech">HomeTech (MiniPC / NAS / UPS / Robot Vacuum)</option>
                <option value="tools">Tools / Live Compare / General</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="rep-sku" class="block font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-slate-600">
                {isKo ? "제품 슬러그 또는 페이지 경로" : "SKU Slug or Page Route"}
              </label>
              <input
                id="rep-sku"
                type="text"
                placeholder={isKo ? "예: apple-mac-mini-m4" : "e.g. apple-mac-mini-m4"}
                class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 font-mono text-sm text-slate-900 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="rep-field" class="block font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-slate-600">
                {isKo ? "오류 항목 선택" : "Specification Field"}
              </label>
              <select
                id="rep-field"
                class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-900 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none"
              >
                <option value="Power / Wh / Wattage">
                  {isKo ? "소비전력 / Wh / 출력 (W)" : "Power Draw / Wh / Wattage"}
                </option>
                <option value="Port Allocation / Protocols">
                  {isKo ? "멀티포트 분배 / PD·PPS 프로토콜" : "Port Allocation / PD·PPS Protocols"}
                </option>
                <option value="Airline Carry-On Rule">
                  {isKo ? "항공사 기내반입 / 국토부·CCC 규정" : "Airline Carry-On / MOLIT / CCC Rule"}
                </option>
                <option value="Nutrition Facts / Active Cost">
                  {isKo ? "영양성분표 / 유효성분 함량" : "Nutrition Facts / Active Weight"}
                </option>
                <option value="Hookless / Bike Compatibility">
                  {isKo ? "후크리스 공기압 / BB·구동계 호환" : "Hookless 5 bar / Bike Compatibility"}
                </option>
                <option value="UPS Waveform / 220V Voltage">
                  {isKo ? "UPS 정현파 / 100-240V·220V 전압" : "UPS Waveform / 100-240V Voltage"}
                </option>
                <option value="MSRP / Discontinued Status">
                  {isKo ? "공식 MSRP / 단종·후속 모델" : "Official MSRP / Discontinued Status"}
                </option>
                <option value="Other / Translation">
                  {isKo ? "기타 / 번역·오탈자" : "Other / Localization"}
                </option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="rep-source" class="block font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-slate-600">
                {isKo ? "공식 원천 출처 URL (Tier 1–2 권장)" : "Official Source URL (Tier 1–2 HTTPS)"}
              </label>
              <input
                id="rep-source"
                type="url"
                placeholder="https://manufacturer.com/manual.pdf"
                class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 font-mono text-sm text-slate-900 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="rep-details" class="block font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-slate-600">
              {isKo ? "현재 표기값 vs 공식 확인값 및 상세 설명" : "Current vs Official Verified Value & Notes"}
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="rep-details"
              rows="3"
              placeholder={isKo
                ? "예: 현재 Idle 9W로 표기되어 있으나 공식 v2 매뉴얼 p.14 기준 7.5W입니다."
                : "e.g. Listed idle power is 9W, but official rev.2 datasheet p.14 states 7.5W."}
              class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-900 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3">
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600">
              {isKo ? "생성된 마크다운 미리보기" : "Generated Markdown Preview"}
            </div>
            <pre
              id="rep-preview"
              class="mt-1.5 max-h-40 overflow-auto whitespace-pre-wrap font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-700"
            ></pre>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-1">
            <a
              id="rep-github-link"
              href="https://github.com/kbu3986/specmatrix-global/issues/new"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-blue-700"
            >
              <span>{isKo ? "GitHub 정정 이슈 바로 열기 ↗" : "Open Pre-Filled GitHub Issue ↗"}</span>
            </a>

            <button
              id="rep-copy-btn"
              type="button"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 transition-colors hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700"
            >
              {reporterCfg.copyBtnText}
            </button>
          </div>
        </section>
      )}

      <div class="space-y-6">
        {pageData.sections.map((sec) => (
          <section class="space-y-2.5">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">{sec.heading}</h2>
            {sec.body.map((para) => (
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">{para}</p>
            ))}
          </section>
        ))}
      </div>

      <footer class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">
        {isKo ? "최종 갱신일:" : "Last updated:"} {cfg.updatedAt} · SpecMatrix Global
      </footer>
    </article>

    <aside class="lg:col-span-3">
      <div class="lab-card p-4">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">
          {isKo ? "신뢰·정책 문서" : "Trust & Legal Docs"}
        </h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm">
          {LEGAL_SLUGS.map((s) => (
            <li>
              <a
                href={withBase(`/${locale}/${s}/`)}
                aria-current={s === legal ? "page" : undefined}
                class:list={[
                  "block rounded-md px-3 py-2 font-medium transition-colors",
                  s === legal
                    ? "bg-slate-900 text-white"
                    : "text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-900",
                ]}
              >
                {LEGAL_LABELS[s][locale]}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import { copyToClipboard } from "../../lib/clipboard";

  interface ReporterCfg {
    locale?: string;
    repoIssuesUrl?: string;
    copiedText?: string;
    copyFailedText?: string;
    copyBtnText?: string;
  }

  (() => {
    const box = document.getElementById("spec-discrepancy-form");
    if (!box) return;

    let cfg: ReporterCfg = {};
    try {
      cfg = JSON.parse(box.getAttribute("data-config") || "{}") as ReporterCfg;
    } catch {
      cfg = {};
    }

    const verticalEl = document.getElementById("rep-vertical") as HTMLSelectElement | null;
    const skuEl = document.getElementById("rep-sku") as HTMLInputElement | null;
    const fieldEl = document.getElementById("rep-field") as HTMLSelectElement | null;
    const sourceEl = document.getElementById("rep-source") as HTMLInputElement | null;
    const detailsEl = document.getElementById("rep-details") as HTMLTextAreaElement | null;
    const previewEl = document.getElementById("rep-preview");
    const ghLink = document.getElementById("rep-github-link") as HTMLAnchorElement | null;
    const copyBtn = document.getElementById("rep-copy-btn") as HTMLButtonElement | null;

    const track = (name: string, params?: Record<string, unknown>) => {
      const w = window as unknown as {
        smTrack?: (ev: string, p?: Record<string, unknown>) => void;
      };
      if (typeof w.smTrack === "function") w.smTrack(name, params);
    };

    // Prefill from ?sku=&vertical= query params
    try {
      const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      const qVertical = (params.get("vertical") || "").trim().toLowerCase();
      const qSku = (params.get("sku") || "").trim();
      if (qVertical && verticalEl) {
        for (let i = 0; i < verticalEl.options.length; i += 1) {
          if (verticalEl.options[i].value === qVertical) {
            verticalEl.value = qVertical;
            break;
          }
        }
      }
      if (qSku && skuEl) {
        skuEl.value = qSku;
      }
    } catch {
      // ignore URLSearchParams errors
    }

    function buildReport(): string {
      const vertical = verticalEl ? verticalEl.value : "wattcheck";
      const sku = (skuEl?.value || "").trim() || "(not specified)";
      const field = fieldEl ? fieldEl.value : "Other";
      const source = (sourceEl?.value || "").trim() || "(please attach official URL)";
      const details = (detailsEl?.value || "").trim() || "(describe current vs official value)";

      const title = `[Spec Correction] [${vertical}] ${sku} — ${field}`;
      const markdown = [
        "### SpecMatrix Discrepancy Report",
        `- **Locale:** \`${cfg.locale || "en"}\``,
        `- **Vertical:** \`${vertical}\``,
        `- **SKU / Route:** \`${sku}\``,
        `- **Field:** ${field}`,
        `- **Official Source URL:** ${source}`,
        "",
        "#### Verified Discrepancy Details",
        details,
      ].join("\n");

      if (previewEl) previewEl.textContent = markdown;
      if (ghLink) {
        const base = cfg.repoIssuesUrl || "https://github.com/kbu3986/specmatrix-global/issues/new";
        const qs =
          `?title=${encodeURIComponent(title)}` +
          `&body=${encodeURIComponent(markdown)}` +
          `&labels=${encodeURIComponent("spec-correction")}`;
        ghLink.setAttribute("href", base + qs);
      }
      return markdown;
    }

    [verticalEl, skuEl, fieldEl, sourceEl, detailsEl].forEach((el) => {
      if (!el) return;
      el.addEventListener("input", buildReport);
      el.addEventListener("change", buildReport);
    });

    if (ghLink) {
      ghLink.addEventListener("click", () => {
        track("spec_report_github", {
          vertical: verticalEl ? verticalEl.value : "",
          sku: skuEl ? skuEl.value : "",
        });
      });
    }

    if (copyBtn) {
      let resetTimer: number | undefined;
      copyBtn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
        const md = buildReport();
        const ok = await copyToClipboard(md);
        if (resetTimer !== undefined) window.clearTimeout(resetTimer);
        if (ok) {
          copyBtn.textContent = cfg.copiedText || "Copied ✓";
          copyBtn.classList.remove("border-rose-400", "text-rose-700", "bg-rose-50");
          copyBtn.classList.add("border-emerald-500", "text-emerald-700", "bg-emerald-50");
          track("spec_report_copy", {
            vertical: verticalEl ? verticalEl.value : "",
            sku: skuEl ? skuEl.value : "",
          });
        } else {
          copyBtn.textContent = cfg.copyFailedText || "Copy failed — select preview text manually";
          copyBtn.classList.remove("border-emerald-500", "text-emerald-700", "bg-emerald-50");
          copyBtn.classList.add("border-rose-400", "text-rose-700", "bg-rose-50");
        }
        resetTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {
          copyBtn.textContent = cfg.copyBtnText || "Copy Report Markdown";
          copyBtn.classList.remove(
            "border-emerald-500",
            "text-emerald-700",
            "bg-emerald-50",
            "border-rose-400",
            "text-rose-700",
            "bg-rose-50"
          );
        }, 2400);
      });
    }

    buildReport();
  })();
</script>
